### controllers/postgres
#### [MODIFY] [aiController.js](file:///C:/Users/revin/Downloads/Capstone/controllers/postgres/aiController.js)
- Remove the duplicated `fetchGroqChatWithFallback` and `fetchGroqVisionWithFallback` functions.
