#### [MODIFY] [forecastingController.js](file:///C:/Users/revin/Downloads/Capstone/controllers/postgres/forecastingController.js)
- Remove the duplicated `fetchGroqChatWithFallback` function.
- Import and use the unified client from `utils/groqClient.js`.
- Add a periodic cleanup script in `getActiveSuggestionsInternal` or a separate utility to prune declined recommendations older than 7 days, keeping the DB lean. (e.g., `await prisma.declinedRecommendation.deleteMany({ where: { declinedAt: { lt: sevenDaysAgo } } })`).

